# Served through the /storage symlink (public/storage -> storage/app/public).
# Once the image proxy caches a file here, Apache serves it directly on
# later requests without going through Laravel; this keeps the same
# Cache-Control it would get from the proxy itself.
<IfModule mod_headers.c>
    <FilesMatch "\.(jpe?g|png|webp|gif|svg)$">
        Header set Cache-Control "public, max-age=86400"
    </FilesMatch>
</IfModule>
